{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的部分感受描写过度具象化，甚至引入童年、初恋、旧房子等原本叙事没有铺垫的联想，容易让观众从人物关系中分神；感受词密集时也会增加扫屏负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最明显的优势是话里的关键心理转折被放大加亮，观众不必读完每句话就能抓住人物从试探、放松、害怕失去到接受不确定性的变化；感受又随着音乐出现，减少了一次性堆在屏幕上的信息。尤其是反复出现的水波、漂浮、摇荡、靠岸等意象，让音乐感受和人物关系形成了连续的联系，细节也比X更有身体感和音乐现场感。X的双栏结构其实更容易区分叙事与感受，文字也比较克制，但右侧短词缺少时间上的展开，容易变成一组需要自行拼接的情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "01cd3c0d-a470-4756-aa30-4a959085e0be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230824928121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:09:09.810302+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "936d5379d44a47aa7afc67bd25af412adb26a79088a256ac7466ea0ff5fb63c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223